# PART 10 — WILDLIFE AND HUNTING

## 10.1 Region-appropriate wildlife

Potential wildlife includes:

- Antelope and gazelle species.
- Elephants in suitable habitats.
- Buffalo in appropriate environments.
- Warthogs.
- Monkeys and other forest wildlife.
- Crocodiles and hippos around suitable waterways.
